    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Hubspot Workflow\n\n**Purpose**: n8n workflow: Hubspot Workflow. 6 nodes wired together. Uses: hubspot, pipedrive, cron, stopAndError. Sourced from czlonkowski/Zie619 n8n-workflows community archive (workflows/Hubspot/0130_HubSpot_Cron_Automate_Scheduled.json). Configure credentials and any hardcoded IDs before activating.\n\n**Services needed**: hubspot, pipedrive, cron, stopAndError\n\n**Difficulty**: 5min-config\n\n**Setup**:\n1. Configure credentials for the services above\n2. Update any hardcoded IDs / URLs\n3. Test with sample data before activating\n\n_Source: https://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows_\n_Curated by ai-ops-architect on 2026-05-05_",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 480
      },
      "name": "Setup Guide (delete after configuring)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        -400
      ],
      "id": "ai-ops-sticky-header"
    },
    {
      "name": "Hubspot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "position": [
        750,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": true,
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "hubspotApi": {
          "id": "{{ $credentials.hubspotApi.id }}",
          "name": "hubspot_nodeqa"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "758f95e5-ee18-48c1-b4c4-0f0229718284",
      "notes": "This hubspot node performs automated tasks as part of the workflow."
    },
    {
